    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a procedurally generated icosphere mesh. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Extends <ref refid="class_forge_1_1_mesh" kindref="compound">Mesh</ref> to generate a spherical geometry using an icosahedron as its base geometry. Supports configurable radius, subdivision levels, inverted geometry, and spherical UV coordinate generation. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
